1035+ 6AB9 07               rlca
1036+ 6ABA 07               rlca
1037+ 6ABB 07               rlca
1038+ 6ABC 07               rlca
1039+ 6ABD E6 03            and  3
1040+ 6ABF 12               ld   (de), a
1041+ 6AC0 13               inc  de
1042+ 6AC1
1043+ 6AC1                  ; Cella 2: bit 3-2
